					</td>
					<td id="NewsCell" width="100%"><font size = 4><b>The roof the roof the roof is on fire!</font></b> <br><font size = 2><i>Solanthious          - 2/10/2003 2:40:56 PM</i></font><br><br><P>Been a pretty busy weeks for us goats, what with all the patchs. Tuesday we started off with a nice little <STRONG>Xanamech</STRONG> killing in <STRONG>Plane of Innovation</STRONG>, hoping he would cough up the mt weapon, yeah, we're not that lucky. Grats <STRONG>Calten</STRONG> on <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16478>Innovators Ring</A>, and <STRONG>Kyley</STRONG> on <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16392>Pulsing Phase Emmiter</A>. We got an attempt in on the <STRONG>Maenetic Behemoth</STRONG> on Wednesday, we got him to 29%, totally not ready for the AoE's. He'll die next time. Thursday we got <STRONG>Statue of Rallos Zek</STRONG> with a small group, grats <STRONG>Munblin</STRONG> on <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=5802>Cloak of the Falling Stars</A>, <STRONG>Sosk</STRONG> on <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=5802>Breastplate of Eradication</A> and <STRONG>Zachen</STRONG> on his Sleepers Tomb Key. Spent the rest of the night feeling nostalgic, and hit up <STRONG>NTOV</STRONG>, check here for the <A href=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/lootlog.aspx>Loot Log</A>. Alot of great gear obtained that night. Friday we had a load of mobs, Grats <STRONG>Dyeisha</STRONG> on her <STRONG>Ancient Prismatic Fistwraps</STRONG>, <STRONG>Zachen</STRONG> and <STRONG>Mistii</STRONG> on their <STRONG>Ancient Prismatic Axes</STRONG>. <STRONG>Klandicar</STRONG> coughed up a <STRONG>ST key</STRONG> for <STRONG>Fernassassin</STRONG> as well. Go hit up <STRONG>Lendinaria the Keeper</STRONG>, looking to close out or <STRONG>ST keys</STRONG>, grats <STRONG>Dalyn</STRONG> the pallygoat on key, our mage recruit <STRONG>Fabilaar</STRONG> picked up <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=5862>Silver Girdle of Stability</A> and <STRONG>Judanu</STRONG> on finally getting her <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6207>Gloves of Stability</A>. 1 hour 15 minutes left on the clock as Lanys was being brought down, and <STRONG>Statue of Rallos Zek</STRONG> pops. Can we do it? can we pull off the triplets in that amount of time???</P>
<P><A href=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/flawaow.JPG><IMG height=300 src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/flawaow.JPG width=300 border=0></A></P>
<P>Picture perfect tank switchs...AFTER I died of course. 39 this time...will slowly start to decrease. Grats <STRONG>Lilpeanuts</STRONG> on <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6040>Boots of the Vindicator</A>, <STRONG>Dalyn</STRONG> on <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6278>Breastplate of Eradication</A>, <STRONG>Murioz</STRONG> the twink on <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=5687>Hammer of Battle</A>, incidentally he also won a <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=5521>Chestplate of Vindication</A> the very next day. <STRONG>Oobydewby</STRONG> got <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6414>Iron Scroll of War</A> and <STRONG>Wrethard</STRONG> got the Sleepers Tomb Key. Grats <STRONG>Nihnyes</STRONG> on his new <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=8171>Helmet of Rallos Zek</A>, <STRONG>Chenzhan</STRONG> on <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=8941>Flayed Barbarian Skinned Leggings</A> and <STRONG>Kyley</STRONG> on the <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=7994>Ring of Destruction</A>.</P>
<P>Saturday we started off with Vindy / Statue again, grats <STRONG>Murioz</STRONG> and bank on <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=5745>Swiftblade of Zek</A>, <STRONG>Zatronn</STRONG> on the Sleepers Tomb key, and I let <STRONG>Exloidin</STRONG> loot the Hammer of Battle, I felt bad after I somehow managed to kill his group.</P>
<P>Cleared to <STRONG>Tunare</STRONG>, grats <STRONG>Jarhn</STRONG> on <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=7041>Massive Heartwood Thorn</A>, <STRONG>Menellaos</STRONG> on <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=12726>Girdle of Living Thorns</A>, <STRONG>Treaes</STRONG> on <A href?=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=7026>Golden Leaf Earring</A> and <STRONG>Bananea</STRONG> on <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=12308>Fist of Nature</A>. <STRONG>Tormax</STRONG> gave us <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6139>Crown of the Kromzek Kings</A> for both <STRONG>Karnage</STRONG> and <STRONG>Mistii</STRONG>, <STRONG>Razzrah</STRONG> skated away with a <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6387>White Dragonscale Sash</A>, <STRONG>Aeralla</STRONG> picked up KT Head for <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6766>White Dragonscale Helm</A>, <STRONG>Zatronn</STRONG> got <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=5627>Ring of Lightning</A>, and <STRONG>Ekilam</STRONG> picked up his ST key.</P>
<P><A href=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/grummus.JPG><IMG height=30 src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/grummus.JPG width=30 border=0></P>
<P></A><STRONG>Grummus</STRONG> dead, Grats <STRONG>Xaijin</STRONG> on <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16520>Runed Lance of Gryme</A>&nbsp;and <STRONG>Collier</STRONG>&nbsp;on <A href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16521>Chunk of Decaying Cloth</A>, amazing fight last night, way to stick it out.</P>
<P><STRONG><FONT size=7>WTF!?!?!</FONT></STRONG></P>
<P><STRONG><FONT size=7><IMG src=/oryx/images/dye.JPG></FONT></STRONG></P>
<P><STRONG><FONT size=4>Someones eager to keep on dieing.</FONT></STRONG></P>
<P><IMG src=/oryx/images/scyas.JPG></P>
<P>Truer words have never been spoken.</P><br><hr align = left width = 10%><font size = 4><b>Freak on a leash?</font></b> <br><font size = 2><i>Solanthious          - 2/4/2003 10:59:30 AM</i></font><br><br><P>I love being a goat. We graze, we bleet, most of all we kick ass. <STRONG>Dain Frostweaver </STRONG>slaughtered again, grats <STRONG>Qindyin</STRONG> on <STRONG>Belt of Dwarf Slaying </STRONG>and <STRONG>Munblin </STRONG>on <STRONG>Tri-Plated Golden Hackle Hammer.</STRONG> Fun fight as always.</P>
<P>So I'm running around looking for targets up, low and behold <STRONG>Shei Vinitras</STRONG> was actually up. Goats run to <STRONG>Akheva</STRONG> for the chance at a new encounter.</P>
<P><A href=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/shei.JPG><IMG height=300 src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/shei.JPG width=300 border=0></A>&nbsp;</P>
<P>Excuse me for the bad pic...some inky bard got in my way of a good shot. Grats <STRONG>Erzhan</STRONG> on <STRONG>Shadowsong Cloak</STRONG>, <STRONG>Svifwin </STRONG>on <STRONG>Flowing Gossamar Cloak,</STRONG> and <STRONG>Lilpeanuts </STRONG>on <STRONG>Akhevan Shadow Sheers.</STRONG> Great first kill.</P>
<P>Axed the ancients again, getting the last members keyed for ST.</P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P><A href=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/ancient1.JPG><IMG height=300 src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/ancient1.JPG width=300 border=0></A><A href=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/ancient2.JPG><IMG height=300 src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/ancient2.JPG width=300 border=0></A> <A href=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/ancient3.JPG><IMG height=300 src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/ancient3.JPG width=300 border=0></A><A href=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/ancient4.JPG><IMG height=300 src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/ancient4.JPG width=300 border=0></A>\</P>
<P>Grats <STRONG>Kenal</STRONG> on <STRONG>Ancient</STRONG> <STRONG>Prismatic</STRONG> <STRONG>Mace</STRONG>, <STRONG>Mudd</STRONG> on <STRONG>Ancient</STRONG> <STRONG>Prismatic</STRONG> <STRONG>Bow</STRONG>, <STRONG>Erzhan</STRONG>, <STRONG>Lilpeanuts</STRONG> and <STRONG>Floob</STRONG> on <STRONG>Ancient</STRONG> <STRONG>Prismatic</STRONG> <STRONG>Stilletos</STRONG>....heh don't ask,&nbsp;last but not least <STRONG>Xaijin</STRONG> and <STRONG>Drayn</STRONG> on <STRONG>Ancient</STRONG> <STRONG>Prismatic</STRONG> <STRONG>Claidhmores</STRONG>.&nbsp;Tons of great little items obtained by a ton of different people. Fun was had by all.</P>
<P>We're also working on <STRONG>PONB</STRONG> flags, expect a dead <STRONG>Terris</STRONG> <STRONG>Thule</STRONG> up here soon. Maybe some <STRONG>Halls</STRONG> <STRONG>of</STRONG> <STRONG>Honor</STRONG> trials, becaue every obstical put in front of us we just graze right through it.</P><br><hr align = left width = 10%><font size = 4><b>Aerin'Dar shouts Badass dragon looking for rez!</font></b> <br><font size = 2><i>Solanthious          - 1/31/2003 2:15:15 AM</i></font><br><br><P><A href=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/aerindar.JPG><IMG height=300 src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/aerindar.JPG width=300 border=0></A> 
<P>Uhhh yeah...tell me again we can't do an encounter. <STRONG>Aerin'Dar</STRONG> is nothing, straight up, its those god damn adds that make this fight. Luckily the add team was badass and 43 goats got flagged tonight. Hard work paid off, grats to us, <STRONG>Fernassassin</STRONG> on <STRONG>Wrath of Mithanial, </STRONG>and <STRONG>Zatronn</STRONG> on <STRONG>Honorary Amulet. Halls of Honor Trials </STRONG>here we come.</P>
<P>Got <STRONG>King Tormax</STRONG> yesterday for the first time, again tonight before we axed <STRONG>Lendinaria the Keeper</STRONG>, <STRONG>Dain</STRONG> again, <STRONG>Yelinak, Kland, Zland, and Klandicar</STRONG> in the last 24 hours. Check out the loot list, alot of great upgrades obtained.</P>
<P><A href=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/loot24hours.JPG><IMG height=300 src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/loot24hours.JPG width=300 border=0></P></A>
<P>Stay Tuned!!!</P>
<P><FONT size=5><STRONG>WTF</STRONG></FONT></P>
